    kind: work_item  # a3d5
    title: "The untyped-receiver caveat names the wrong thing in two languages: objc renders an empty method name, java carries the receiver prefix so the boundary-scoped caveat cannot match the catalogue"  # a3d5
    status: todo_soft  # a3d5
